//# Imports

// Re-export facade: `lookup_builtin` lives in ./checker. (A bare
// `export { lookup_builtin }` block used to follow; it referenced a local
// that doesn't exist — harmless under the flat bundle, but the FS merge
// resolves it to "undefined variable (local)" (#726). The re-export alone
// is the correct form.)
// One hop, straight to the defining file (a chained re-export through
// ./checker/index.vibe is not resolved transitively by the FS merge).
export ./checker/builtins.vibe {
  lookup_builtin
}
